        {
          "text": "\" 'Pazuva rechishanu, mugadzire hando pfumbamwe, makondobwe maviri uye namakwayana makono gumi namana egore rimwe chete, zvose zvisina kuremara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.26",
