              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muisewo nhongo yembudzi imwe chete sechipiriso chechivi, muchipamhidzira kuchipiriso chinopiswa chamazuva ose pamwe chete nechipiriso chacho chezviyo uye nechipiriso chokunwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.31",
